#: hetu/cli/migrate.py:37
msgid ""
"在数据库执行Schema升级脚本,如果没有则创建，如果无变更则跳过。同时还会进行临时表的清空。应该在CI/CD流程中，每次启动服务器前执行一次。"
msgstr ""
"Executes schema upgrade scripts in the database, creating them if they don't"
" exist and skipping if there are no changes. Also clears temporary tables. "
"Should be executed once before each server start in the CI/CD pipeline."

#: hetu/cli/migrate.py:44 hetu/cli/start.py:95
msgid "后端数据库地址，默认 redis://127.0.0.1:6379/0"
msgstr "Backend database address, defaults to redis://127.0.0.1:6379/0"

#: hetu/cli/migrate.py:48
msgid "河图app的py文件，默认 app.py"
msgstr "Python file for the hetu app, defaults to app.py"

#: hetu/cli/migrate.py:54 hetu/cli/start.py:84
msgid "启动app.py中哪个namespace下的System"
msgstr "Which System under which namespace in app.py to start"

#: hetu/cli/migrate.py:57 hetu/cli/start.py:87
msgid "实例名称，每个实例是一个副本"
msgstr "Instance name, each instance is a replica"

#: hetu/cli/migrate.py:63
msgid "通过yml配置文件读取后端数据库地址。不给且没用命令行参数时，依次找环境变量 HETU_CONFIG、当前目录的 config.yml"
msgstr ""
"Reads the Backend database address from a yml configuration file. If not "
"provided and no command-line argument is used, it looks for the HETU_CONFIG "
"environment variable, then config.yml in the current directory"

#: hetu/cli/migrate.py:72
msgid "自动确认数据备份提示"
msgstr "Automatically confirms the data backup prompt."

#: hetu/cli/migrate.py:78
msgid "强制执行升级迁移，丢弃无法迁移的数据。请勿在生产环境使用此选项！"
msgstr ""
"Forces the upgrade migration, discarding data that cannot be migrated. Do "
"not use this option in production!"

#: hetu/cli/migrate.py:85
msgid "跳过重建索引。默认每次升级都按行数据重建持久组件的索引、修掉索引残留，数据量大时较慢"
msgstr ""
"Skip rebuilding indexes. By default, each upgrade rebuilds indexes for "
"persistent Components from row data and fixes leftover indexes, which is "
"slower when the data volume is large"

#: hetu/cli/migrate.py:121
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"❌ 检测到还有服务器在运行（持有 Worker ID "
"租约：{ids}），请先停服再升级：迁移、清空易失表、重建索引在服务器运行时执行都会写坏数据。服务器是异常退出的，等租约过期（最多 {ttl} "
"秒）后再试。"
msgstr ""
"❌ Detected that servers are still running (holding Worker ID leases: {ids})."
" Please stop the servers before upgrading: running migrations, clearing "
"volatile tables, and rebuilding indexes while servers are running will "
"corrupt data. The servers exited abnormally; wait for the leases to expire "
"(at most {ttl} seconds) and try again."

#: hetu/cli/migrate.py:129
#, python-brace-format
msgid "   其中 {ids} 是 hetu call / shell 进程，等它们结束即可（异常退出的最多 {ttl} 秒过期）。"
msgstr ""
"   Here {ids} are hetu call / shell processes; just wait for them to finish "
"(abnormally exited ones expire in at most {ttl} seconds)."

#: hetu/cli/migrate.py:147
msgid "⚠️  升级数据库表结构可能会导致数据丢失，请确保已备份数据。确认继续请输 y ，取消请输其他键然后回车："
msgstr ""
"⚠️  Upgrading the database schema may cause data loss. Please ensure you "
"have backed up your data. Enter 'y' to confirm and continue, or any other "
"key and press Enter to cancel:"

#: hetu/cli/migrate.py:152 hetu/cli/migrate.py:179
msgid "❌  升级迁移已取消。"
msgstr "❌  Upgrade migration has been canceled."

#: hetu/cli/migrate.py:169
msgid "❗ Component有数据删除或类型变更，请修改自动生成的迁移脚本，手动处理这些属性。或使用--drop-data参数直接丢弃这些属性。"
msgstr ""
"❗ Component has data deletion or type changes. Please modify the auto-"
"generated migration script to handle these attributes manually. Or use the "
"--drop-data parameter to discard these attributes directly."

#: hetu/cli/migrate.py:176
msgid "⚠️  确认强制迁移请输 y ，取消请输其他键然后回车："
msgstr ""
"⚠️  Enter 'y' to confirm forced migration, or any other key and press Enter "
"to cancel:"

#: hetu/cli/migrate.py:183
#, python-brace-format
msgid "⚠️  正在强制迁移 {instance_name} 服所有表结构，可能会丢失数据..."
msgstr ""
"⚠️  Forcing migration of all table structures for the {instance_name} "
"instance, data may be lost..."

#: hetu/cli/migrate.py:191
#, python-brace-format
