"{overdue:.1f} seconds, refusing to issue IDs to prevent duplicate IDs. This "
"usually means this process has been stuck for a long time or the backend is "
"unreachable, and the Worker will restart at the next lease renewal."

#: hetu/common/snowflake_id.py:181
