msgstr ""
"Component {comp_name}'s commit sequence column `{field}` has duplicate "
"numbers within a group while rebuilding the index: {rows} (at most {limit} "
"listed). Duplicate numbers cause consumers to silently skip the following "
"row; please write a migration script to renumber first."

#: hetu/data/backend/redis_model.py:143
#, python-brace-format
