msgstr ""
"Component {comp_name}'s commit sequence column `{field}` has numbers "
"reaching the upper limit 2^53 while rebuilding the index: {rows} (at most "
"{limit} listed); after that, every commit in these groups will fail. Please "
"write a migration script to renumber first."

