#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{comp_name}.{cols} 是提交序号列 {field} 的分组列，这一行已经有号（{seq}），不能改分组列：搬到别的组会和那一组的号重复"
msgstr ""
"{comp_name}.{cols} are the group columns of the commit sequence column "
"{field}. This row already has a number ({seq}), so the group columns cannot "
"be changed: moving it to another group would duplicate that group's numbers"

