msgid "upsert只能用于unique索引，{comp_name}组件的{index_name}不是unique索引"
msgstr ""
"Upsert can only be used on unique indexes. Index {index_name} of component "
"{comp_name} is not a unique index."

#: hetu/data/backend/repo.py:1094
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{comp_name}.{index_name}={value} 不存在：本 Session 不发雪花号，upsert 只允许命中已有行，或改用 "
"upsert(id=...) 显式给出 id"
msgstr ""
"{comp_name}.{index_name}={value} does not exist: this Session does not issue"
" snowflake IDs; upsert only allows matching existing rows, or use "
"upsert(id=...) to explicitly provide an id."

#: hetu/data/backend/repo.py:1109
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"upsert 的锚定值超过了 {comp_name}.{index_name} 的列宽 "
"{max_len}：{value}。新行存进去会被截断，之后拿这个值查不到它"
msgstr ""
"The upsert anchor value exceeds the column width {max_len} of "
"{comp_name}.{index_name}: {value}. The new row would be truncated when "
"stored, and this value would then not find it"

#: hetu/data/backend/session.py:237
msgid "事务超过最大重试次数。"
msgstr "Transaction exceeded the maximum number of retries."

