msgstr ""
"[❄️ID] [Development mode] Using local process sequence number as Worker ID: "
"{worker_id}. This mode only guarantees uniqueness within a single machine; "
"for multi-machine deployment, switch to the Redis backend."

#: hetu/data/backend/redis/worker_keeper.py:179
