msgid ""
"Redis数据库 {url} 不支持 HELLO 命令（RESP3 握手）。通常是前面挂了不支持 RESP3 的代理层，请在 url 后追加 "
"?protocol=2 降级到 RESP2，master 和 servants 都要加。"
msgstr ""
"Redis database {url} does not support the HELLO command (RESP3 handshake). "
"This is usually caused by a proxy layer in front that does not support "
"RESP3. Please append ?protocol=2 to the url to downgrade to RESP2; this must"
" be added for both master and servants."

