"[❄️ID] 续约 Worker ID {worker_id} 失败: "
"租约已不属于本进程（可能因本进程长时间卡住导致租约过期后被其他实例接手），继续发号会产生重复雪花ID，将重启Worker..."
msgstr ""
"[❄️ID] Failed to renew Worker ID {worker_id}: the lease no longer belongs to"
" this process (possibly because this process was stalled for a long time, "
"causing the lease to expire and be taken over by another instance). "
"Continuing to issue IDs would generate duplicate snowflake IDs; restarting "
"Worker..."

#: hetu/data/backend/redis/worker_keeper.py:281
